@james7132, is this issue still unresolved? Seems to have been taken care of by #4402.

`Extract` only takes shared borrows on the main world, we avoid copying command queues since the render world runs it, and the main world is handed back before they're applied. If it wasn't already, `Extract` should be the only sync point between the worlds once they're running in parallel.

And the main world being exclusively held during `Extract` doesn't seem like an issue. I could be missing something, but the main schedule will have finished or nearly finished its work by then.

